+++ b/releasenotes/notes/delay-since-first-attempt-26e6e80f02dc0258.yaml
@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@
+---
+fixes:
+  - |
+    The ``delay_since_first_attempt`` key is now present in the ``statistics``
+    dictionary from the start of each run, with the value ``0`` until a delay
+    has occurred. Previously it was missing until after the first retry, so
+    reading it during the first attempt raised ``KeyError``.
